factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script and caption say the godown was built under the 'Tamil Nadu Chief Minister's food security scheme' (தமிழக முதலவரின் உணவு பாதுகாப்பு திட்டம்); the article only says the Chief Minister takes various measures through the department, with no named scheme.
  The reel_script says the Minister 'opened' (திறந்து வைத்தார்) the godown; the article says he started it by lighting a kuthuvilakku (குத்துவிளக்கேற்றி தொடங்கி வைத்து), which the draft only mentions in the caption, not the reel. (Minor)
